{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digital Creative Framework (DCF) \u2013 Forge Worlds. Break Limits. Build Forever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born in a Utah lakehouse garage by a 30-year IT vet who stared at Pac-Man at 8 and whispered: &quot;One day we'll make movies too.&quot; Oranje 44 ripped the gates off gaming. DCF 1.993: UE5.6.1 fork. Headless. Zero bloat. One persistent 256 km\u00b2 voxel continent that <i>remembers everything</i>. No fees. No limits. Spawn in the real Oranje 44 garage replica. Pet the K9. Rev the bike. Carve reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d TRINITY PILLARS \u2013 No Silos. Pure Power.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pillar 1: SOURCE</strong> Clean compile. Steam Workshop runtime. Real-Time Import  \u2192 live spawn). GAS abilities. Offline speech-to-world. ML ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pillar 2: WORLD</strong> Voxel Pro 1.2: Runtime terraform + foliage streaming. Oceanology sunsets. Ultra Dynamic Sky 9.2. Ghost Replay: Film any angle/speed. Every carve saves to .sav \u2013 Workshop instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pillar 3: ACCESS</strong> <strong>Player Mode:</strong> Digital Dive cars/bikes (perfect sync). Travesty AAMS motion. Mutable MetaHumans. Build/terraform multiplayer (LAN/Internet). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae CORE LOOP \u2013 Your Wrench, Your Rules.</strong> WASD + double jump. N: Drone toggle. H: Terraform (Shift dig, paint biomes). G: Snap builds (Q edit/demo). T: Epic zoom. Z: Parachute. Tab: Free cursor. Workshop Bench: Save verse \u2192 upload maps/models/textures/sounds (.sav magic). Subs spawn identical worlds. Hyper3D.ai \u2192 import \u2192 share \u2192 done. Examples live: Realm of Lucian (runtime mega-continent). Endar. Wizards Track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scales Everywhere:</strong> GTX 1070 Ti compiles king. Stable on 4GB low-end. 5080 ultra native. Same binary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We don\u2019t build games.</strong> <strong>We build builders.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3161440?t=1768801099","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768801099","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161440/97c74a6a8b6bcca897fde53e1c4b771d0bd9df52/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768801099","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161440/97c74a6a8b6bcca897fde53e1c4b771d0bd9df52/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768801099","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digital Creative Framework (DCF) \u2013 Forge Worlds. Break Limits. Build Forever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born in a Utah lakehouse garage by a 30-year IT vet who stared at Pac-Man at 8 and whispered: &quot;One day we'll make movies too.&quot; Oranje 44 ripped the gates off gaming. DCF 1.993: UE5.6.1 fork. Headless. Zero bloat. One persistent 256 km\u00b2 voxel continent that <i>remembers everything</i>. No fees. No limits. Spawn in the real Oranje 44 garage replica. Pet the K9. Rev the bike. Carve reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d TRINITY PILLARS \u2013 No Silos. Pure Power.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pillar 1: SO